{"ID":"20240506082112-0mrjww6","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240506082112-0mrjww6","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240506082112-0mrjww6\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240627081648-5q7jokr\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240612131138-w0ad2x0\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:2200,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240627082222-mq9wed7\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:3,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:3\u0026#125;","title":"235蚱蝉（蝉蜕）","type":"doc","updated":"20240821161352"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240726112622-t1fsocb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240726112622-t1fsocb","updated":"20240726112622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产于河南、河北、江苏、四川、山东等地。\n【性状】\t全形似蝉而中空，稍弯曲。长约4cm，宽约2cm。表面黄棕色，半透明，有光泽。头部有丝状触角1对，多已断落，复眼突出，颈部先端突出，口吻发达，上唇宽短，下唇伸长成管状。胸部背面呈十字形裂片，裂口向内卷曲，脊背两旁具有小翅2对；腹面有足3对，被黄棕色细毛。腹部钝圆，共9节。体轻，中空，易碎。无臭，味淡。\n【性味】\t甘，寒。\n【功效】\t散风除热，利咽，透疹，退翳，解痉。用于风热感冒，咽痛，音哑，麻疹不透，风疹瘙痒，目赤翳障，惊风抽搐，破伤风。"}]},{"ID":"20240726112622-yd5ytg3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240726112622-yd5ytg3","updated":"20240726112622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206110351-prni2p0.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240726112622-6de4l9d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240726112622-6de4l9d","updated":"20240726112622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蝉蜕"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蝉蜕-20240205154936-ejc45lg.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240627081648-5q7jokr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240627081648-5q7jokr","updated":"20240821160856"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 568px;","style":"width: 558px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240627082222-o182pny.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 558px;\" parent-style=\"width: 568px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 655px;","style":"width: 645px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蚱蝉5"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蚱蝉5-20240627082101-v7tj4lz.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 645px;\" parent-style=\"width: 655px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240821160822-hrhi1qm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240821160822-hrhi1qm","updated":"20240821160822"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 546px;","style":"width: 536px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蚱蝉1"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蚱蝉1-20240627081648-zqtqyz6.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 536px;\" parent-style=\"width: 546px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 617px;","style":"width: 607px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蝉"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蝉-20240821160616-2rfdiry.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 607px;\" parent-style=\"width: 617px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240821161051-p5hknw1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240821161051-p5hknw1","updated":"20240821161108"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 627px;","style":"width: 617px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蝉 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蝉 2-20240821161003-ihqh3zl.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 617px;\" parent-style=\"width: 627px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 540px;","style":"width: 530px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蝉 (5)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蝉 5-20240821161108-jvi0k9w.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 530px;\" parent-style=\"width: 540px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240821161125-07g55sd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240821161125-07g55sd","updated":"20240821161125"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 375px;","style":"width: 365px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蚱蝉4"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蚱蝉4-20240627081942-aceunmt.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 365px;\" parent-style=\"width: 375px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 787px;","style":"width: 777px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蚱蝉2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蚱蝉2-20240627081750-grbk0dt.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 777px;\" parent-style=\"width: 787px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240821161245-5ehjw1u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240821161245-5ehjw1u","updated":"20240821161247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 792px;","style":"width: 782px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蝉 (7)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蝉 7-20240821161245-phmp08g.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 782px;\" parent-style=\"width: 792px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 411px;","style":"width: 401px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蝉 (6)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蝉 6-20240821161158-slwj07j.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 401px;\" parent-style=\"width: 411px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240821161043-qoedqil","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240821161043-qoedqil","updated":"20240821161352"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 622px;","style":"width: 612px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蝉 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蝉 4-20240821161043-q17iia9.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 612px;\" parent-style=\"width: 622px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 623px;","style":"width: 613px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蝉 (8)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蝉 8-20240821161352-kmji2or.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 613px;\" parent-style=\"width: 623px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240612131137-p9j150i","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612131137-p9j150i"}},{"ID":"20240612131302-s568nz4","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612131302-s568nz4","updated":"20240612131306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蚱蝉《神农本草经读》"}]},{"ID":"20240612131302-v044o9u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131302-v044o9u","updated":"20240612131302"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（古人用蝉，今人用蜕，气性亦相近。）气味寒、咸。主小儿惊痫、夜啼，癫病寒热。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131302-8acqkfc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131302-8acqkfc","updated":"20240612131302"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陈修园曰∶蚱蝉气寒禀水气，味咸得水味，而要其感凉风清露之气以生，得金气最全。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131302-e2ox36r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131302-e2ox36r","updated":"20240612131302"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"其主小儿惊痫者，金能平木也。蚱蝉日出有声，日入无声，故止夜啼也。癫病寒热者，肝胆之风火也，蚱蝉具金水之气，金能制风，水能制火，所以主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131302-zwnof2h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131302-zwnof2h","updated":"20240612131302"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"张隐庵曰∶蝉脱、僵蚕，皆禀金水之精，故《本经》主治，大体相同。但蝉饮而不食，溺而不粪；蚕食而不饮，粪而不溺，何以相同？经云∶“饮入于胃……，上归于肺……。”谷入于胃，乃传之肺。是饮食虽殊，皆由肺气之通调，则尿粪虽异，皆禀肺气以传化矣。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131302-iebkst5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131302-iebkst5","updated":"20240612131302"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石膏气味辛、微寒，无毒。主中风寒热，心下逆气惊喘，口干舌焦，不能息，腹中坚痛，除邪鬼，产乳，金疮。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131302-5irzp73","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131302-5irzp73","updated":"20240612131302"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陈修园曰∶石膏气微寒，禀太阳寒水之气；味辛无毒，得阳明燥金之味。风为阳邪，在太阳则恶寒发热，然必审其无汗烦燥而喘者，可与麻桂并用；在阳明则发热而微恶寒，然必审其口干舌焦大渴而自汗者，可与知母同用。曰心下气逆，即《伤寒论》，气逆欲呕之互词；曰不能息，即《伤寒论》虚羸少气之互词；然必审其为解后里气虚而内热者，可与人参、竹叶、半夏、麦冬、甘草、粳米同用。腹中坚痛，阳明燥甚而坚，将至于胃实不大便之症。邪鬼者，阳明邪实，妄言妄见，或无故而生惊，若邪鬼附之，石膏清阳明之热，可以统治之。阳明之溃烂也。但石品见火则成锻石，今人畏其寒而用，则大失其本来之性矣。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131341-ewyu4ad","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612131341-ewyu4ad"}},{"ID":"20240612131447-ja5r8pe","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612131447-ja5r8pe","updated":"20240612131453"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蚱蝉《千金翼方》"}]},{"ID":"20240612131447-wciz3qm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131447-wciz3qm","updated":"20240612131447"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸甘，寒，无毒。主小儿惊痫，夜啼癫病，寒热惊悸，妇人乳难，胞衣不出。又堕胎。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131447-yfre9py","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131447-yfre9py","updated":"20240612131447"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生杨柳上，五月采，蒸干之，勿令蠹。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131447-qeel7e2","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612131447-qeel7e2"}},{"ID":"20240612131458-bdpj0uf","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612131458-bdpj0uf","updated":"20240612131503"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蚱蝉《本经逢原》"}]},{"ID":"20240612131458-ycqh2en","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131458-ycqh2en","updated":"20240612131458"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"咸甘寒无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131458-15477h6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131458-15477h6","updated":"20240612131458"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》主小儿惊痫夜啼，癫病寒热。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131458-uy27u1v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131458-uy27u1v","updated":"20240612131458"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"发明"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蝉主产难下胎衣，取其能蜕之义。《圣惠》治小儿发癫有蚱蝉汤、散、丸等方。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131458-d5t5yw3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131458-d5t5yw3","updated":"20240612131512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"今人只知用蜕而不知用蝉也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131512-342aaoi","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612131512-342aaoi"}},{"ID":"20240612131513-h48b08j","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612131513-h48b08j","updated":"20240612131518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蝉《本草述钩元》"}]},{"ID":"20240612131513-lpo4b7p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131513-lpo4b7p","updated":"20240612131513"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本出土中。自蛴螬腹转相变化。夏则登木而蜕。身与声俱大。其鸣以胁。吸风饮露。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131513-fllgks8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131513-fllgks8","updated":"20240612131513"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"溺而不粪。性畏日。至三十日死。其类甚多。如仲夏始鸣。方首广额。大而色黑者蚱蝉。又曰。曰蚂蜩。头上有花冠者曰螗蜩。曰。曰胡蝉。具五色者曰螂蜩。入药用此数种。若秋月始鸣诸种。用之无益。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131513-ezs1ef6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131513-ezs1ef6","updated":"20240612131513"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸甘。气寒。入肝经祛散风热。主小儿惊痫夜啼。痫绝不能言。去壮热。癫病寒热。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131513-mswgvjg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131513-mswgvjg","updated":"20240612131513"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"惊悸其体轻蚕天竺黄各半分。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131513-9mzxpjw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131513-9mzxpjw","updated":"20240612131513"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蜕"}]},{"ID":"20240612131513-j043gne","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131513-j043gne","updated":"20240612131513"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸甘。气寒。治头风眩晕螈。目痛目赤。及肿胀昏花。内外障翳。小儿噤风天吊。疮疹出不快。痘疮作痒。妇人生子不下。补风虚。（好古）蝉性蜕而退翳。蛇性窜而祛风。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131513-zkmunvv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131513-zkmunvv","updated":"20240612131513"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因其性而为用也。（又）蝉古人用身。后人用蜕。大抵治脏腑经络。当用蝉身。治皮肤疮疡风同羚羊角密蒙花白蒺藜草决明木贼谷精甘菊夜明砂生地黄连女木毒十候〔论〕蝉身本浊阴而化清阳。（从阴化阳。乃阴中之少阳。非阳中之太阳也。日为太阳。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131513-j19yp96","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131513-j19yp96","updated":"20240612131513"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所味阴痘亦补剂中。世医漫谓能疗风热。是未审于转达清阳之气以治化源之义耳。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131513-mk31c47","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131513-mk31c47","updated":"20240612131513"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔修治〕去翅足。水洗去土。蒸过用。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131523-xfbmqmm","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612131523-xfbmqmm"}},{"ID":"20240612131525-rb408rw","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612131525-rb408rw","updated":"20240612131532"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蚱蝉蝉花《增广和剂局方药性总论》"}]},{"ID":"20240612131525-fblst5t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131525-fblst5t","updated":"20240612131525"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸甘，寒，无毒。主小儿惊痫夜啼，癫病寒热，惊悸，妇人乳难，胞衣不出。又堕胎，《药性论》云∶使。味酸。主治小儿惊哭不止，杀疳虫，去壮热，治肠中幽幽作声。又云蝉蜕，使。主治小儿浑身壮热，惊痫，兼能止渴。蝉花∶味甘，寒，无毒。主小儿天吊，惊痫螈，夜啼心悸。出∶蜀中。其蜕壳头上有一角，如花冠状，谓之蝉花，最佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131459-tmq1lmj","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612131459-tmq1lmj"}},{"ID":"20240612131435-dj4bg2k","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612131435-dj4bg2k","updated":"20240612131441"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蚱蝉《冯氏锦囊秘录》"}]},{"ID":"20240612131435-b2hqtxs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131435-b2hqtxs","updated":"20240612131435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蝉壳，禀木土之余气化而成形，其飞鸣又得风露之清气，故能入肝风散热，主小儿壮热，惊痫，主妇人生子不下者，其取蜕脱之义，其鸣清响。能发音声，其性善蜕，能脱翳障，其体轻浮，能发疮疹，其味甘寒，能除风热。及皮肤风热，天吊惊哭夜啼等症也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131435-1ljpwcn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131435-1ljpwcn","updated":"20240612131435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蚱蝉，治产妇胎衣不下，通乳堕胎。主小儿惊痫夜啼，驱邪逐热。蝉花乃生壳顶上，状类花冠，止天吊螈 ，心悸怔忡。蝉蜕，系脱换薄壳，去翳膜侵睛。 肉满 ，取性之善脱也。疗哑病夜啼，取昼鸣夜息也，善发痘疹，取轻浮易透肌肤也，疗壮热惊痫，取味甘咸而寒，可散风热也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131435-jjk4i4u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131435-jjk4i4u","updated":"20240612131435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主治（痘疹合参） 蝉蜕，能发痘疹不快，解毒而退风热，兼能明目，又治风气客于皮肤，搔痒不止，凡红紫热甚者可用，寒症忌之，又曰不论寒热虚实皆可用，头面痘不起用头，足不起用足，身不起用身，乃退热止痒之圣药也。倒陷黑陷者，便可酒洗研末，汤调服之，兼参 同用，则虚痒自愈。但能润肌滑窍，多服恐泄元气，以致表虚。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131435-8t80tmg","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612131435-8t80tmg"}},{"ID":"20240612131421-pixxmlo","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612131421-pixxmlo","updated":"20240612131429"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蚱蝉《本草衍义》"}]},{"ID":"20240612131421-clabpa7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131421-clabpa7","updated":"20240612131421"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"夏月身与声皆大者是，始终一般声，仍皆乘昏夜方出土中，升高处，背壳坼蝉出。所以皆夜出者，一以畏人，二畏日炙，干其壳而不能蜕也。至时寒则坠地，小儿蓄之，虽数日亦不须食。古人以谓饮风露，信有之。盖不粪而溺，亦可见矣。西川有蝉花，乃是蝉在壳中不出而化为花，自项中出。又，壳治目昏翳。又水煎壳汁，治小儿出疮疹不快，甚良。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131421-n1nddeb","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612131421-n1nddeb"}},{"ID":"20240612131408-zycfkui","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612131408-zycfkui","updated":"20240612131413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蚱蝉《本草崇原》"}]},{"ID":"20240612131408-4w5d6s6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131408-4w5d6s6","updated":"20240612131408"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气味咸甘寒，无毒。主治小儿惊痫，夜啼，癫病寒热。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131408-ewjwnxa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131408-ewjwnxa","updated":"20240612131408"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（蝉者总名也，其类不一。二三月即先鸣，小而色黑者，名 母，今浙人谓之蛮虫。五月始鸣，大而色黑者，马蜩也。《毛诗》∶五月鸣蜩。《月令》∶仲夏之月，蝉始鸣即是。此种今浙人谓之老蝉，土音讹为老潜，又谓之蚕蝶。《本经》所谓蚱蝉者，正此蝉也。今时药中所用蝉蜕亦是此蝉之蜕。其头上有花冠者，曰冠蝉，又曰蜩螗。《毛诗》∶如蜩如螗是也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131408-xywztw2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131408-xywztw2","updated":"20240612131408"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小而色青绿者，曰茅蜩，又曰茅 ，今浙中谓之蜘 。秋月始鸣，小而色青紫者，曰蟪蛄。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131408-i8590yi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131408-i8590yi","updated":"20240612131408"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《庄子》∶蟪蛄，不知春秋者是也。未立秋以前喑而不鸣，先谓之哑蝉，又曰喑蝉。入秋而鸣，时天候渐寒，故又谓之寒蝉，又曰寒蜩，又曰寒 。《月令》∶孟秋之月，寒蝉鸣，即是此种。其余颜色少异，音声略殊，尚有多名，形皆相似。方首广额，两翼六足，升高而鸣，鸣不以口而以胁，吸风饮露，溺而不粪，三十日而死，古时用蝉身，今时只用蝉蜕，不复用身。）"}]},{"ID":"20240612131408-g5rmpl8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131408-g5rmpl8","updated":"20240612131408"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蝉感秋气而生，应月周而去，禀金水之气化也。金能制风，水能清热，故主治小儿惊痫。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131408-6k77cf1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131408-6k77cf1","updated":"20240612131408"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"昼鸣夜息，故止小儿夜啼。水火不交，则癫病寒热。蝉禀金水之精，能启下焦之水气，上合心包，故治癫病寒热。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131408-e1yf9o1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131408-e1yf9o1","updated":"20240612131408"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（蚱蝉生于夏月，寒蝉生于秋时，今概谓蝉感秋气而生，禀金水之气者，恐未是缪。仲醇曰∶蚱蝉禀水土之精，风露之气化而成形。其鸣清响，能发音声。其体轻浮，能出疮疹。其味甘寒，能除风热。其性善蜕，能脱翳障，及女子生子不下。）"}]},{"ID":"20240612131408-fdpfu9x","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612131408-fdpfu9x"}},{"ID":"20240612131355-eyokbrm","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612131355-eyokbrm","updated":"20240612131401"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蚱蝉《名医别录》"}]},{"ID":"20240612131355-r7qwoha","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131355-r7qwoha","updated":"20240612131355"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘，无毒．主治惊悸，妇人乳难，胞衣不出，又堕胎．五月采，蒸干之，勿令蠹．又，壳名枯蝉，一名伏 ，主小儿痫，女人生子不出，灰服之，主久痢．"}]},{"ID":"20240612131355-cmcg5dm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131355-cmcg5dm","updated":"20240612131355"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》原文∶蚱蝉，味咸，寒．主小儿惊痫夜啼，癫病寒热．生杨柳上．"}]},{"ID":"20240612131355-3snl0zn","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612131355-3snl0zn"}},{"ID":"20240612131343-8dhgm5b","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612131343-8dhgm5b","updated":"20240612131349"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蚱蝉《新修本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240612131343-4wfv7d7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131343-4wfv7d7","updated":"20240612131343"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸、甘，寒，无毒。主小儿惊痫，夜啼，癫病，寒热，惊悸，妇人乳难，胞衣不出，又堕胎。生杨柳上。五月采，蒸干之，勿令蠹。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131343-jnrhthr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131343-jnrhthr","updated":"20240612131343"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蚱字音作榨，即是哑蝉。哑，雌蝉也，不能鸣者。蝉类甚多。庄子云∶蟪蛄不知春秋，则是今四月、五月小紫青色者。而《离骚》云∶蟪蛄鸣兮啾啾，岁暮兮不自聊，此乃寒 尔，九又二月中便鸣者名 母，似寒而小；七月、八月鸣者名 ，色青。今此云生杨柳树上是。《诗》云∶鸣蜩 者，形大而黑，伛偻丈夫，止是掇此，昔人啖之。故《礼》有雀 蜩范，范有冠，蝉有 ，亦谓此蜩。此蜩复五月便鸣。俗云五月不鸣，婴儿多灾，今其疗亦专主小儿也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131343-2ws2kfa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131343-2ws2kfa","updated":"20240612131343"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔谨案〕《别录》云∶壳名枯蝉，一名伏 ，主小儿痫，女人生子不出，灰服之，主久痢；又云蚱者，鸣蝉也，主小儿痫，绝不能言；今云哑蝉，哑蝉则雌蝉也，极乖体用，按诸虫兽，以雄者为良也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131323-2eojaez","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612131323-2eojaez"}},{"ID":"20240612131325-c75mpig","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612131325-c75mpig","updated":"20240612131336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蚱蝉《本草乘雅半偈》"}]},{"ID":"20240612131325-jyeowsy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131325-jyeowsy","updated":"20240612131325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（本经中品）"}]},{"ID":"20240612131325-qn7eibe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131325-qn7eibe","updated":"20240612131325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【气味】咸甘寒，无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131325-c8rt8an","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131325-c8rt8an","updated":"20240612131325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【主治】主小儿惊痫，夜啼，癫病，寒热。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131325-2ukw4s2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131325-2ukw4s2","updated":"20240612131325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【核】曰∶夏月始生，自蛴螬腹 ，转相变化，乘昏夜出土中，拆袭壳背而出。亦有蜣螂转丸化生者，形大而黑，方首广额，两翼六足，其鸣以胁，吸风饮露，溺而不粪，三十日而死也。古人多食之，夜以火取，谓之耀蝉，古人用身，今人用蜕，大抵脏腑经络宜用身，皮肤缪仲淳先生云∶蚱蝉禀水土之精，风露之气，化而成形，其鸣清响，能发音声，其体轻浮，能出疮疹，其味甘寒，能除风热，其性善蜕，能脱翳障，及女子生子不下也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131325-n8ogxjx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131325-n8ogxjx","updated":"20240612131325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【 】曰∶蚱蝉，即夏至始鸣之蜩也。论衡曰∶蛴螬背行，化为蝮 ，蝮 者，育于蝮，蝮背拆，转为玄蝉，化为离应，舍卑秽而趋高洁者也。淮南子云∶无口而鸣，其鸣以胁，饮而不食，以息饮也。三十日乃化，盖自背而腹，自行而拆，此从督及任，循任会督之象也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131325-ts0hitu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131325-ts0hitu","updated":"20240612131325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"三十日乃化者，如卫气日下一节，二十一日而终督，上行九日而终任，则周月之化，如周月之蒸，蒸则变，变则化矣。无口不食者，此亦转督与任之道欤。故主小儿不能从蒸及变，内逆而为惊痫癫疾寒热，与不鸣于昼，反啼于夜者，皆厥藏番阴之证也。亦有转丸背拆，化为玄蝉，运转任督，以及蒸变，义更明显。蜕主生子不下，亦取解甲变化之易耳。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131325-p23wyxm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131325-p23wyxm","updated":"20240612131325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（以一微物，具此至理。若以大小贵贱起见者，是局于知闻之褊浅，观释氏诠 蜣为六即佛，以其性与三世诸佛同体，无有分厘增减，则形中之类任督，与卫行督二十一度，任九度，弥月环周，积数余而蒸变作，克肖乎人，便不怪异，即此可推蒸变巳周，女二七，男二八，精气溢泻，月事以时下之所繇然矣。故古人命名立言，虽极微一物，亦有至理存焉。如蛴螬之背行，先循乎督，蝮 之育腹，专依乎任，蝮 背拆，化为玄蝉，复循任会督，其如环无端之象。转展化育，始全蒸变之全局耳。）"}]},{"ID":"20240612131313-8gp8k21","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612131313-8gp8k21"}},{"ID":"20240612131314-oyaapqd","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612131314-oyaapqd","updated":"20240612131318"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蚱蝉《神农本草经百种录》"}]},{"ID":"20240612131314-f65ejzh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131314-f65ejzh","updated":"20240612131314"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"古人用蝉，今人用蜕，气性亦相近。味咸寒。主小儿惊痫夜啼，癫病寒热。皆小儿风热之疾。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131314-3l3xsc0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131314-3l3xsc0","updated":"20240612131314"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蚱蝉感凉风清露之气以生，身轻而声嘹亮，得金气之发扬者也。又脱落皮壳，亦属人身肺经之位，故其性能清火驱风，而散肺经之郁气。若其质轻虚，尤与小儿柔弱之体为宜也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131314-3x5w1tj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131314-3x5w1tj","updated":"20240612131314"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蚱蝉日出有声，日入无声，止夜啼，取其意也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131137-5qtfjb8","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612131137-5qtfjb8"}},{"ID":"20240612131153-61trts3","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612131153-61trts3","updated":"20240612131201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蚱蝉《本草纲目》"}]},{"ID":"20240612131153-h8ulat7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131153-h8ulat7","updated":"20240612131153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「释名」调、齐女。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131153-tf976q5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131153-tf976q5","updated":"20240612131153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「气味」咸、甘、寒、无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131153-ksr0vd3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131153-ksr0vd3","updated":"20240612131153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「主治」"}]},{"ID":"20240612131153-1nhvf9f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131153-1nhvf9f","updated":"20240612131153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、百日发惊。用蚱蝉（去翅足，炙过）三分、赤芍药三分、黄芩二分，加水二碗，煎成一碗，温服。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131153-90ul83z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131153-90ul83z","updated":"20240612131153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、破伤风病（角弓反张）。用秋蝉一个、地肤子（炒）八分、麝香少许，共研为末，酒送服二钱。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131153-sv0md50","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131153-sv0md50","updated":"20240612131153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、头负疼痛。用蚱蝉二个，生研，加乳香、朱砂各半分，做成丸子，如小豆大，每用一丸，随头所在的一侧纳入鼻中，以出黄水为有效。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131137-2njer0d","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612131137-2njer0d"}},{"ID":"20240612131138-0ebrf9u","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612131138-0ebrf9u","updated":"20240612131138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中药大辞典》：蚱蝉"}]},{"ID":"20240612131138-28beqp1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131138-28beqp1","updated":"20240612131138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240612131138-wykka49","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131138-wykka49","updated":"20240612131138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Zhà Chán"}]},{"ID":"20240612131138-h8dw50c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131138-h8dw50c","updated":"20240612131138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240612131138-l0vjf7y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131138-l0vjf7y","updated":"20240612131138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 鸣蜩（《诗经》），蝒、马蜩（《尔雅》），螃（《方言》），鸣蝉（《唐本草》），秋蝉（《圣惠方》），蜘蟟（《七修类稿》），蚱蟟（《中药志》），知了（《江苏药材志》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131138-iqmiokx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131138-iqmiokx","updated":"20240612131138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240612131138-m3u51d0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131138-m3u51d0","updated":"20240612131138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本经》"}]},{"ID":"20240612131138-lof0ido","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131138-lof0ido","updated":"20240612131138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240612131138-y143d3t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131138-y143d3t","updated":"20240612131138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为蝉科昆虫"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"黑蚱"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"全虫"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。6～7月间捕捉，捕得后蒸死，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131138-7w8x21j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131138-7w8x21j","updated":"20240612131138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240612131138-so3nakj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131138-so3nakj","updated":"20240612131138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 成虫多栖于柳、插、枫杨及苹果、梨、桃、杏等阔叶树木上。全国大部地区均有分布。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131138-ngepcva","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131138-ngepcva","updated":"20240612131138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240612131138-6cqahhn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131138-6cqahhn","updated":"20240612131138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 雄虫体长而宽大，长4.4～4.8厘米，翅展12.5厘米，雌虫稍短；黑色，有光泽。头部横宽，中央向下凹陷，颜面顶端及侧缘淡黄褐色。复眼1对，大而横宽，呈淡黄褐色；单眼3个，位于复眼中央，排列呈三角形。触角短小，位于复眼前方。前胸背板两侧边缘略扩大，中胸背板有2个隐约的中央线状淡赤褐色的锥形斑。翅2对，透明有反光，翅脉显明，前缘淡黄褐色，翅基室1/3为黑色，亚前缘室呈黑色，并有一淡黄褐色斑点。后翅基部2/5为黑色。雄虫具鸣器，雌虫则无。足3对，淡黄褐色，腿节上的条纹、胫节基部及端部均黑色。腹部各节黑色，末端略尖，呈钝角。雄虫腹盖发达，不及腹部的一半，外缘呈弧形隆起；腹盖的外缘与后缘、各腹节的后缘以及分布在腹面分散的点，均为淡黄褐色。雌虫腹盖不发达，产卵器显著。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131138-ktcgzzh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131138-ktcgzzh","updated":"20240612131138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生活史长，一个世代要经12～13年。若虫进入土内，吸取树根汁液，经几次蜕皮羽化为成虫。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131138-961rfgv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131138-961rfgv","updated":"20240612131138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本昆虫的蜕壳（蝉蜕）亦供药用，另详专条。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131138-8wia2yx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131138-8wia2yx","updated":"20240612131138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240612131138-6yfzi0d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131138-6yfzi0d","updated":"20240612131138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本草汇言》：\"入手太阴、足厥阴经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612131138-l2nb1gc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131138-l2nb1gc","updated":"20240612131138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240612131138-arzy6t0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131138-arzy6t0","updated":"20240612131138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 咸甘，寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131138-jjyxqm3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131138-jjyxqm3","updated":"20240612131138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"味咸，寒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612131138-x13j90j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131138-x13j90j","updated":"20240612131138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"甘，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612131138-su0wgxg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131138-su0wgxg","updated":"20240612131138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240612131138-awmj7li","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131138-awmj7li","updated":"20240612131138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 清热，熄风，镇惊。治小儿惊风，癫痫，夜啼。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131138-64qtqhz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131138-64qtqhz","updated":"20240612131138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"主小儿惊痫，夜蹄，癫病，寒热。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612131138-9dx8fag","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131138-9dx8fag","updated":"20240612131138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"主惊悸，妇人乳难，胞衣不出，又堕胎。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612131138-9p8t6te","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131138-9p8t6te","updated":"20240612131138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《药性论》：\"主小儿惊哭不止，杀疳虫，去壮热，治肠中幽幽作声。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612131138-yd2sw81","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131138-yd2sw81","updated":"20240612131138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《唐本草》：\"主小儿痫绝不能言。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612131138-n1y3a7o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131138-n1y3a7o","updated":"20240612131138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240612131138-dqfazpu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131138-dqfazpu","updated":"20240612131138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，1～3个；或入丸、散。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131138-l84u635","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131138-l84u635","updated":"20240612131138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240612131138-b1i4c6a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131138-b1i4c6a","updated":"20240612131138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治小儿风热惊悸：蚱蝉半两（去翅、足，微炒），茯神半两，龙齿三分（细研），麦门冬半两（去心，焙），人参三分（去芦头），钩藤三（二）分，牛黄二钱（细研），蛇蜕皮五寸（烧灰），杏仁二分（汤浸，去皮、尖、双仁，麸炒微黄）。捣罗为散。每服以新汲水调下半钱，量儿大小，加减服之。（《圣惠方》蚱蝉散）"}]},{"ID":"20240612131138-um64haj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131138-um64haj","updated":"20240612131138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治小儿初生百日内发痫：蚱蝉（煅）、赤芍药各三分，黄芩二分。为末。水一小盏，煎至五分，去滓服。（《普济方》蚱蝉散）"}]},{"ID":"20240612131138-7nf3ylt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131138-7nf3ylt","updated":"20240612131138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治诸风痫，胸中痰盛：干蚱蝉七枚（微炙），白藓皮一两，钩藤、细辛（去土）、川芎（锉，微炙）、天麻、牛黄（别研）各一分，蛇蜕五寸许（炙令黄）。上捣罗为末，同牛黄拌匀。每服一钱，水八分，入人参、薄荷各少许，煎五分，去滓，稍热服。（《普济方》蚱蝉汤）"}]},{"ID":"20240612131138-2sejikh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131138-2sejikh","updated":"20240612131138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治小儿天钓，眼目搐上，筋脉急：蚱蝉一分（微炒），干蝎七枚（生用），牛黄一分（细研），雄黄一分（细研）。上药细研为散。不计时候，以薄荷汤调下一字，量儿大小加减服。（《圣惠方》蚱蝉散）"}]},{"ID":"20240612131138-fadzc6l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131138-fadzc6l","updated":"20240612131138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240612131138-34r4zwu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131138-34r4zwu","updated":"20240612131138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240612131138-w0ad2x0","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612131138-w0ad2x0","updated":"20240612131138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中华本草》：蚱蝉"}]},{"ID":"20240612131138-i9h9y4s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131138-i9h9y4s","updated":"20240612131138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240612131138-m7y438b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131138-m7y438b","updated":"20240612131138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Zhà Chán"}]},{"ID":"20240612131138-i3j2ben","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131138-i3j2ben","updated":"20240612131138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240612131138-su5x702","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131138-su5x702","updated":"20240612131138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 碉、鸣蜩、蝒、马蜩、蟧、鸣蝉、秋蝉、蜘蟟、炸蟟"}]},{"ID":"20240612131138-43juhap","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131138-43juhap","updated":"20240612131138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240612131138-7nkjyzj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131138-7nkjyzj","updated":"20240612131138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Cicada"}]},{"ID":"20240612131138-me8mgd6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131138-me8mgd6","updated":"20240612131138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240612131138-j83maaz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131138-j83maaz","updated":"20240612131138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 出自《神农本草经》。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131138-ll43cgz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131138-ll43cgz","updated":"20240612131138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.《名医别录》：(蚱蝉)五月采，蒸干之，勿令蠹。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131138-onfwkrq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131138-onfwkrq","updated":"20240612131138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《本草衍义》：蚱蝉，夏月身与声皆大者是。始终一般声，仍皆乘昏夜方出土中，升高处，背壳拆，蝉出。所以皆夜出者，一以畏人，二畏日炙干其壳而不能蜕也。至时寒则坠地。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131138-tm3debj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131138-tm3debj","updated":"20240612131138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《纲目》：蝉，诸蜩总名也。夏月始鸣。大而色黑者，炸蝉也。曰蝒，曰马蜩，《诗》五月鸣蜩者是也。头上有花冠，曰螗蜩，曰蝘，曰胡蝉，《荡诗》如蜩如"}]},{"ID":"20240612131138-mo2jywx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131138-mo2jywx","updated":"20240612131138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240612131138-qps6av6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131138-qps6av6","updated":"20240612131138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 药材基源：为蝉科动物黑蚱的全体。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131138-2l6fnma","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131138-2l6fnma","updated":"20240612131138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：Cryptotympana pustulata Fabr"}]},{"ID":"20240612131138-h1qdahl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131138-h1qdahl","updated":"20240612131138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：6-7月间捕捉，捕后蒸死、晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131138-csd14ok","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131138-csd14ok","updated":"20240612131138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240612131138-w9ikyy4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131138-w9ikyy4","updated":"20240612131138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生态环境：栖于杨、柳、榆、槐、枫杨等树上。经过一个世代往往要12-13年。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131138-39cl04f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131138-39cl04f","updated":"20240612131138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：分布于我国辽宁以南的大部分地区。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131138-7kwpezl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131138-7kwpezl","updated":"20240612131138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240612131138-nreoi6v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131138-nreoi6v","updated":"20240612131138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 黑蚱，体大色黑而有光泽；雄虫长4.4-4.8cm，翅展约12.5cm，雌虫稍短。复眼1对，大形，两复眼间有单眼3只，触角1对。口顺发达，刺吸式，唇基梳状，上唇宽短，下唇延长成管状，长达第3对足的基部。胸部发达，后胸腹板上有一显着的锥状突起，向后延伸。足3对。翅2对，膜质，黑褐色，半透明，基部染有黄绿色，翅静止时覆在背部如屋脊状。腹总值发7节，雄蝉腹部第1节间有特殊的发音器官，雌蝉同一部位有听器。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131138-ivgoqrx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131138-ivgoqrx","updated":"20240612131138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240612131138-f60135p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131138-f60135p","updated":"20240612131138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 性状鉴别，本品呈长圆形，长4-4.5cm，宽1.8-2cm。表面大部分黑色，腹面各部边缘呈淡黄褐色，有光泽。头部宽扁，复眼1对，椭圆状球形，黄褐色，半透明。胸背部具膜质翅，透明，翅脉淡黄褐色，多已破碎。胸腹部上端具足3对，多断落。雄虫下端有1对心形鸣器，雌虫无鸣器，腹部较小，有产卵器。尾端呈三角形钝尖，背部和腹部具环节。体轻，质脆。气微腥，味淡。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131138-dthhvhg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131138-dthhvhg","updated":"20240612131138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240612131138-cylqahb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131138-cylqahb","updated":"20240612131138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 取原药材，除去杂质，筛去灰屑。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131138-0447e84","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131138-0447e84","updated":"20240612131138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240612131138-wggh6dx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131138-wggh6dx","updated":"20240612131138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 肝；肺经"}]},{"ID":"20240612131138-cjijy9l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131138-cjijy9l","updated":"20240612131138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240612131138-s36r448","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131138-s36r448","updated":"20240612131138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 味咸；甘；性寒"}]},{"ID":"20240612131138-yasqh5f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131138-yasqh5f","updated":"20240612131138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240612131138-5xti1bs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131138-5xti1bs","updated":"20240612131138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 清热；熄风；镇惊。主小儿发热；惊风抽搐；癫痫；夜啼；偏头痛"}]},{"ID":"20240612131138-8vfkhn1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131138-8vfkhn1","updated":"20240612131138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240612131138-la7o4ap","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131138-la7o4ap","updated":"20240612131138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，1-3个；或入丸、散。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131138-83u4fz6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131138-83u4fz6","updated":"20240612131138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240612131138-xw6f4rk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131138-xw6f4rk","updated":"20240612131138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治小儿风热惊悸：蚱蝉半两(去翅、足，微炒)，茯神半两，龙齿三分(纲研)，麦门冬半两(去心，焙)，人参三分(去芦头)，钧藤三(二)分，牛黄二钱(细研)，蛇蜕皮五寸(烧灰)，杏仁二分(汤浸，去皮、尖、双仁，麸炒微黄)。捣罗为散。每服以新汲水调下半钱，量儿大小，加减服之。(《圣惠方》蚱蝉散)②治小儿初生百日内发： 蚱蝉(煅)、赤芍药各三分，黄芩二分。为末。水一小盏，煎至五分，去滓服。(《普济方》蚱蝉散)③治诸风痫，胸中痰盛： 干蚱蝉七枚(微炙)， 白藓皮一两，钩藤、细辛(去土)、川芎(锉，微炙)、天麻、牛黄(别研)各一分，蛇蜕五寸许(炙令黄)。上捣罗为末，同牛黄拌匀。每服一钱，水八分，入人参、薄荷各少许，煎五分，去滓，稍热服。 (《普济方》蚱蝉汤)④治小儿天钓，眼目搐上，筋脉急： 蚱蝉一分(微炒)，干蝎七枚(生用)，牛黄一分(细研)，雄黄一分(细研)。上药细研为散。不计时候，以薄荷汤调下一字，量儿大小加减服。(《圣惠方》蚱蝉散)"}]},{"ID":"20240612131138-dla7her","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131138-dla7her","updated":"20240612131138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240612131138-k9ld129","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131138-k9ld129","updated":"20240612131138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.《本经》：主小儿惊痫，夜啼，癫病，寒热。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131138-fetl35j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131138-fetl35j","updated":"20240612131138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《别录》：主惊悸，妇人乳难，胞衣不出，又堕胎。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131138-dhqjvgs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131138-dhqjvgs","updated":"20240612131138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《药性论》：主小儿惊哭不止，杀疳虫，去壮热，治肠中幽幽作声。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131138-0v2n7px","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131138-0v2n7px","updated":"20240612131138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《唐本草》：主小儿痫绝不能言。"}]},{"ID":"20240612131138-x1gdn9s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131138-x1gdn9s","updated":"20240612131138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240612131138-u5xfi8r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131138-u5xfi8r","updated":"20240612131138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240612131121-8jqwpoi","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612131121-8jqwpoi"}},{"ID":"20240612131141-t897rx3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612131141-t897rx3"}}]}